### 拿回所有members的資料
GET http://localhost:3000/members


### 拿回自己的資料
GET http://localhost:3000/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### 查詢會員等級並更新 (User only)
# 回傳格式: { level: number, totalSpent: number }
# Level 規則:
#   Level 1: 總消費 < 5000
#   Level 2: 總消費 >= 5000
#   Level 3: 總消費 >= 10000
#   Level 4: 總消費 >= 15000
GET http://localhost:3000/members/me/level
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}


