### Merchant 拿回自己的詳細資料以及自己的商品
GET http://localhost:3000/members/merchantWithBooks
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### User 想瀏覽該商家賣什麼
GET http://localhost:3000/members/MerchantInfoWithBook/ef450ad3-3d09-4f78-bcbe-70cfe880d224


### Merchant 拿回自己的詳細資料以及自己的商品
GET http://localhost:3000/members/merchantWithBooks
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Merchant 拿回自己的 canAcceptOrder
GET http://localhost:3000/members/canAcceptOrder
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### User 拿回自己的 canCreateReview
GET http://localhost:3000/members/canCreateReview
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}

### User 拿回自己的 canCreateOrder
GET http://localhost:3000/members/canCreateOrder
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}